{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21585","headline":"早春登龙山静胜寺时非休澣司空特许是行因赠幕中诸公 · 元稹","name":"早春登龙山静胜寺时非休澣司空特许是行因赠幕中诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢傅知怜景气新，许寻高寺望江春。\n龙文远水吞平岸，羊角轻风旋细尘。\n山茗粉含鹰觜嫩，海榴红绽锦窼匀。\n归来笑问诸从事，占得闲行有几人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}